			<>
				<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
				<p class="note">The French version (language switch, top right) is the reference text.</p>

				<h2>1. Controller</h2>
				<p>
					Marcin Czajkowski, email: {CONTACT_EMAIL}, <a href={localePath('/contact/', 'en')}>contact form</a>. More
